~ wall_caretaker
if wall_has_warning()
	Iddin-Sin: Raider tracks have been spotted nearby. They are nearing the castle. Prepare the wall.
	=> wall_work
else
	=> wall_work

~ wall_work
if wall_is_attacking()
	Iddin-Sin: The raiders are still attacking. We can repair the wall once they leave.
else
	Iddin-Sin: {{wall_work_summary()}}
- Start wall work [if wall_work_available() and wall_uses_timed_work()]
	do wall_select_work()
	=> END
- Repair wall (free) [if wall_work_available() and not wall_uses_timed_work()]
	do wall_select_work()
	=> END
- Not now
	do wall_select_leave()
	=> END
